      English sign-in strings.

      Every user-facing string lives here and in `values-fr/strings.xml`; the screen
      itself formats nothing (`Project.md` §10, `dev.md` §9). The API returns
      presentation text of its own, but clients branch on stable error codes and show
      their own localized copy (`docs/api/authentication.md` §2, C1).
    -->

